  "details": "<p>The inscribed properties are:\u00a0<strong>Qal'eh Dokhtar</strong>, the <strong>Ardashir Investiture Relief</strong>, the\u00a0<strong>Victory Relief of Ardashir</strong>, <strong>Ardashir Khurreh</strong>,\u00a0<strong>Palace of Ardashir</strong>, the\u00a0<strong>City of Bishapur</strong>, the\u00a0<strong>Shapur cave</strong>, and the <strong>Sarvestan Palace</strong>.</p>",
  "review_state": "published",
  "type": "FeatureCollection",
  "description": "A cultural landscape located in the southeast of Fars Province, Iran, the Sassanid Archaeological Landscape of Fars Region is the official denomination given by UNESCO to eight Sasanian-era archaeological sites. This landscape was recognized as a UNESCO World Heritage Site on 30 June 2018.",
